  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the wood-fired oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Prepare the vegetables by cutting them into 1-inch (2.5 cm) cubes, and place them in a large bowl.",
    "Add the minced garlic, olive oil, paprika, thyme, salt, and black pepper to the bowl and toss to combine.",
    "Transfer the vegetables to a 9x13-inch (23x33 cm) baking dish, and top with the grated cheddar and mozzarella cheese.",
    "Bake the gratin in the wood-fired oven for 20-25 minutes, or until the vegetables are tender and the cheese is golden brown and bubbly.",
    "If desired, sprinkle the powdered sugar over the top of the gratin and return it to the oven for an additional 2-3 minutes, or until the sugar is caramelized."
  ],
